WEBVTT

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:05.270
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:07.400
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:10.150
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:11.990
Shining Finger

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:13.860
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:20.700
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:26.370
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:32.630
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.050
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:48.400
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.690
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:55.190
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.190 --> 00:00:58.280
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:02.290
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:04.040
Bright you now

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:08.540
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:10.880
Shining Finger

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:12.550
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:25.640
I would like to, if I may...

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:29.580
...provide you with an explanation
of the Gundam Fight.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:32.400
It all began in the recent past,
about 60 years ago.

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:37.530
People had left the filthy Earth
to live in Colonies in space.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:40.660
But in order to avoid all-out
war among the Colony nations...

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:43.910
...a competition is held every four
years with representatives...

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:47.210
...from each nation piloting
Gundam machines...

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:48.540
...in what's known as
"Gundam Fights."

00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:52.130
And the pilots fight. And they
fight. And they continue fighting...

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:55.780
...until the nation represented
by the last standing Gundam...

00:01:55.780 --> 00:01:58.970
...earns the right to rule
all the Colony nations.

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:04.140
It's as though they've based war
on principles of sportsmanship.

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:08.350
However,
one problem still remains.

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:11.270
This competition takes place
on Earth.

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:11.980
That's right.

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:14.770
This filthy planet
on which we live.

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:17.400
But this time around...

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:20.400
...there seems to be something
different about the tournament.

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:23.790
Hey, you over there!

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:26.370
Do you remember seeing this guy?

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:30.250
Well, now...

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:34.210
...how might this photo
affect today's fight?

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:42.460
Neo Russia - Bolt Gundam

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:38.300
Today's opponent,
representing Neo Russia...

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:42.470
...is a prisoner
and the Bolt Gundam!

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:44.350
And now!

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:48.560
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:54.810
Great Escape!
A Captive Gundam Fighter

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:53.800
Great Escape! A Captive Gundam Fighter

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:59.150
Oh, yes. I can't really recall
when this place...

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:02.780
...had become known
as the Gundam graveyard.

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:05.740
They say the Gundams
that enter this town...

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:08.620
...vanish without a trace.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.000
Huh? Domon Kasshu?

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:13.460
No. Haven't heard of him.

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:15.960
Tourists never come
to a place like this.

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:19.210
Not to a prison town like this.

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:21.170
But...

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:24.440
...I'm sure that Domon
came to this town.

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:34.360
Gundam graveyard...

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:08.930
Why?

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:11.720
Why are they looking for Gundams?

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:13.270
Why?

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:17.940
Spit it out!

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.650
We know you're a Gundam Fighter!

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:24.070
You've come here to
find Neo Russia's Fighter!

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:25.570
Isn't that right?

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:29.080
I've already told you several times.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:33.040
I just came here for some sightseeing.

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:35.710
Won't give up, huh?!

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:41.590
Come on!

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:44.300
Why don't you just tell us
where your Gundam is?

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:45.300
Now wait a minute.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:49.390
He was only seen wandering
around town, right?

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:51.890
But apparently he was
looking for somebody.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:55.310
We can't conclude that
he's a Fighter based on that.

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:56.440
Sure we can.

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:58.480
Our intelligence network
is always accurate.

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:02.620
That man is no doubt
Neo Japan's Fighter.

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:06.750
But still...

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:11.450
Names of countries?

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:18.750
Hey, you...!

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.840
Who is this man here?

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.050
Well?

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:29.680
Take off these handcuffs!

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:33.220
All right!

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:43.320
Better take him to the doctor,
or he'll never use his arm again.

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:45.570
I'm taking this back.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:47.070
Halt!

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:47.700
Wait...!

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:51.170
Just let him go.

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:56.700
What is it?
What are they plotting?

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:00.670
Give it up!

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:11.510
There's no way you can
get out of here on your own...

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:13.140
...no matter how hard you try!

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:18.600
Big guy...

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:21.350
...looks like you're
also a prisoner.

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:24.610
But unfortunately, I can't waste
my time hanging around here.

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:30.070
Anyone getting in my way
will be forced aside!

00:06:38.470 --> 00:06:40.250
My punch has no effect!

00:06:51.100 --> 00:06:52.140
That's enough!

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:55.100
I still have things I want
to ask that man.

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:59.390
And I'll have you wait patiently
a little while longer...

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:01.410
...Argo Gulskii.

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:09.740
That's right, Father.

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:10.860
Right.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:15.620
I know you can't interfere with
matters outside our borders.

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:19.620
Anyway, please...

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:22.420
Okay, then.
I'll keep an eye on things.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.300
Domon...

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:35.740
...if you keep on worrying me
like this, I'm dumping you.

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:41.600
Domon...

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:43.520
Domon Kasshu...

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:44.980
What's the matter?

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:46.980
What about that man?

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:48.650
Hurry up and catch him...

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:52.150
...along with the Devil Gundam.

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:53.110
That's right.

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:55.950
It's the only way we can save him.

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:59.950
You're the only one
who can save him.

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:03.310
You're the only one!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:10.050
I see you're awake.

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:12.970
You seemed to have had
a bad nightmare.

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:15.510
You should just try to
forget everything.

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:17.260
Now that you're in here...

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:19.060
Checkmate.

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:20.470
It's game over.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:23.180
All right?
Mr. Gundam Fighter?

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:29.730
You can try and hide it, but you can't
get past the Birdman.

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:33.900
Every four years or so,
guys like you end up in here.

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:37.010
Yes.
Caught in a trap.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:43.080
The guys here spread a rumor that
Neo Russia's Gundam is in town.

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:47.670
They capture any Fighter who
shows up from an enemy country...

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.200
...and throw him in here!

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:54.880
That way, Neo Russia is able
to win without even fighting.

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:59.850
If a Fighter is stuck in this place,
where there're no communications...

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:02.770
...no one on the outside
can do anything.

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:04.510
It's goodbye.

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:12.230
And what do you think happens
to the Fighters who are captured?

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:19.410
As you can see, they're forced
to work as hard as they can.

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:23.200
They become a part of
a big group of captured losers.

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:26.460
But it's nothing to laugh at.

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:27.540
Take a look at this.

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:36.300
At this rate, there's no tomorrow.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:38.790
Not for a Gundam Fighter
anyway.

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:41.300
The Neo Russia guys...

00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:44.470
...do this to get information
on the latest technology...

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:46.270
...and use it to build
their own Gundam.

00:09:46.930 --> 00:09:48.580
I bet they're strong.

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:55.650
I'm sure he'll do well for us.

00:09:56.740 --> 00:10:00.780
Plant one of our Fighters as
a spy among the prisoners...

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:01.870
...break down his spirit...

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:04.700
...and get him to reveal
where the Gundam is.

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:07.210
Good thinking.

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:12.670
But, looking at it from another
perspective, this place is paradise.

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:13.340
It's true.

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:16.420
The Fighters who disappear
during the tournament...

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:18.680
...are labeled traitors
against their nation.

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:21.720
Once they're out of here,
they're on the run anyway.

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:22.960
No freedom for them.

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:25.600
You sure do talk a lot.

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:27.140
Or maybe...

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:29.100
...you're one of those
former Gundam Fighters?

00:10:31.350 --> 00:10:33.110
Why, don't be ridiculous!

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:35.610
I'm just your average criminal.

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:39.360
In any case, you might want to let
them know where your Gundam is.

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:45.410
Him...!

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:52.460
What's that guy think he's doing?

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:54.210
Hey! What's going on here?!

00:10:58.590 --> 00:10:59.510
Don't move!

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:02.800
Right. Don't any of
you try anything!

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:04.390
This is good.

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:06.560
And now I'm going
to get out of this place.

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:24.320
Listen...

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:27.200
Meet up with me tomorrow
at the end of our shift.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.200
We're escaping!

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:30.500
What?!

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:37.590
What a crazy fool.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:50.140
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:58.070
Security's a lot tighter
than I thought.

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:01.900
There's no way of knowing
whether Domon's in there or not.

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:03.240
Besides...

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:05.530
...I can't hand over the Core Lander
to him over water.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:12.330
You just never give up, do you?

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:14.490
Better watch it,
or you'll get yourself killed.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:19.170
You'd be better off if you
tell them where your Gundam is.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:21.920
More importantly,
interested in getting out of here?

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:22.880
Wh-what?

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:26.140
You've kept me company.
You want to come along?

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:27.600
Y-you out of your mind?

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:29.930
How will you escape?

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:32.430
Listen, even if you manage
to steal a car...

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:35.140
...you won't make it out
over the sea.

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:38.160
It's impossible!

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:42.240
Just forget about it,
and give up your Gundam!

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:46.570
Boy, it's cold tonight.

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:49.020
I'm shivering.
It's really cold.

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:51.120
What?!

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:52.330
That man's planning an escape?

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:53.670
That's right.

00:12:53.670 --> 00:12:54.830
But that's all I know.

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:56.290
I don't know when or how.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:58.920
Well, what a spy.

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:03.170
What is that man thinking?

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:21.440
Well? Are you coming?

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:23.940
I've decided.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:27.420
Good-bye, birds. I'm out of here!

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:32.240
Get moving!

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:40.380
So, how do you plan to get us out?

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:44.050
What's wrong?

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:53.390
Wow!

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.810
It's a fuel pipe...

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:57.980
...and we're going to light it!

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.400
- Put out the fire!
- Hurry up!

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:09.740
Guards! Restrain the prisoners!

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:14.450
We're going to ram right through it!

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:16.950
There's only water ahead of us!
What'll we do?!

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:17.830
I don't care!

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:24.840
What the...?!

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:27.170
It's frozen!

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:29.700
The sea froze up during the night,
with the cold temperatures!

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:33.550
We're out!
I'm free at last!

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:36.770
I'm free!

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:43.230
Back in contact with Domon!
Great!

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:47.240
That man!

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.700
How could he think about escaping?!

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:50.780
Bolt Gundam!

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:04.710
Okay!

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:06.300
Switch remote control over to me!

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:07.010
Take off!

00:15:16.760 --> 00:15:18.850
We've almost made it to the town!

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:22.140
Well, it sure doesn't look like
we'll get there too easily.

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:28.610
A Gundam?

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:29.900
Hey!

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:33.240
They found us way too quickly!
Did you...?!

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:36.120
No!
I didn't tell them anything!

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:37.120
Then could he...?!

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:41.830
The first step is to stop them.

00:15:58.220 --> 00:15:59.720
Is he the spy?

00:15:59.720 --> 00:16:00.450
But why?!

00:16:00.450 --> 00:16:01.430
Domon!

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:03.980
Hurry!
Here's your Core Lander!

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:07.400
Thank you, Rain!

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:09.070
Go!

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:11.400
Shining Gundam!

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:17.590
So that's Neo Japan's
Shining Gundam.

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:19.970
Yes. Argo was simply after that.

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:23.220
He staged an escape in order
to lure the Gundam out.

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:25.020
Good work!

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:26.810
- Now leave the rest to us...!
- Shut up!

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:30.520
I won't let anyone get
in the way of my battles!

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:32.360
Argo...?

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:36.320
Gundam Fight standby!

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:37.780
Ready!

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:39.320
Go!

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:49.000
A-A real Gundam Fight!

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:07.100
A hammering weapon.

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:10.020
You got us out of there!
Now, I'll return the favor!

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:23.120
Gotcha!

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:27.660
Direct hit!

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:34.300
You're kidding!

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:36.380
That head withstood
Domon's knockout punch!

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:39.090
Don't take Neo Russia's
technology too lightly.

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:53.770
Here I go!

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:10.750
He's done it!

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:12.960
Argo! Go for the head!

00:19:24.550 --> 00:19:27.060
What's wrong?
Is this it?!

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:29.810
Was that gutsy attitude back
at the prison just an act?!

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:31.730
Is this the best you can do?!

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:37.440
I'm taking your head!

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:39.440
Fight's over.

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:41.150
Come on, kid!

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:55.020
This hand of mine glows
with an awesome power!

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:58.050
Its burning grip tells me
to defeat you!

00:19:58.710 --> 00:19:59.750
The ultimate...

00:20:00.070 --> 00:20:04.640
...Shining Finger!

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:23.240
We lost.

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:24.520
Domon!

00:20:24.520 --> 00:20:26.950
No. It's a draw.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:28.910
He's right.

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:32.660
I can't fight him anymore.

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:46.840
That man, Argo Gulskii...

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:52.480
...sensed your fighting spirit
from your punch at the prison.

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:54.940
At that moment, he felt
a deep desire to fight you.

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:56.440
That's why he staged an escape?

00:20:56.770 --> 00:20:57.980
Who knows?

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:04.490
I heard he used to be a space pirate,
plundering the Space Colonies.

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:07.280
He agreed to become
the nation's Fighter...

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:09.200
...in exchange for
the safety of his crew.

00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:11.410
Look.

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:13.450
He's got a bomb fixed to his chest...

00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:15.670
...which means he's
a prisoner for life.

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:19.720
The only remaining freedom
for him is to fight.

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:22.610
Oh, by the way.

00:21:22.610 --> 00:21:24.800
I have no idea who this man is.

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:28.070
So, what do you plan to do now?

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:31.290
When I watched that Fight...

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:35.560
...I was reminded that I too am
a Fighter who gave up freedom.

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:38.310
So, I've decided.

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:41.230
I'm going to run and run
and keep running...

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:43.740
...until I once again find freedom!

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:45.570
And don't you forget.

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:49.490
Article 7 of the Gundam Fight
International Regulations.

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:50.910
"Earth is the."

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:53.950
That's right.

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:57.050
As long as we Fighters
remain here on Earth...

00:21:57.050 --> 00:22:00.380
...we can't deny the fact that
we're just prisoners, too.

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:06.330
I see.

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:08.190
I'm a prisoner, too.

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:11.680
Stuck on this
called Earth.

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:33.080
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:33.450 --> 00:22:37.460
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:41.920
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:45.460
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:52.640
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:58.350
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:58.560 --> 00:23:03.610
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:10.150
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:10.530 --> 00:23:14.280
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:14.450 --> 00:23:20.290
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:31.380 --> 00:23:33.250
It's the moment you've
been waiting for!

00:23:33.250 --> 00:23:36.960
A terrifying test is waiting
for Domon on his return...

00:23:36.960 --> 00:23:39.020
...to the Neo Japan Colony.

00:23:39.020 --> 00:23:41.400
Who is the man in the picture?

00:23:41.400 --> 00:23:43.350
What is the Devil Gundam...

00:23:43.350 --> 00:23:45.020
...the strongest and
most evil of Gundams?

00:23:45.570 --> 00:23:49.150
Domon's true objective
is about to be revealed!

00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:52.230
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:55.530
Fight, Domon! Earth is the Ring!

00:23:54.700 --> 00:24:01.090
Fight, Domon! Earth is the Ring!

00:23:55.870 --> 00:23:58.670
Ready! Go!
